	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia domini tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod nostris de rebus ecclesię<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>que statu aliquot mensibus nullas a me receperis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>litteras, charissime in Christo <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, hisce brevibus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>excusatum iri spero etc.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Hybernis mensibus valetu<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dinarius, iugiter grabbatulo inhęrens rarissime <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nisi bacillo interdum innixus in publicum prodii.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Iam vernali tempore, quo sperabam meliora, pedum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tumor, tormina et erysipela haud aliter <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quam coniurati hostes me, qui alioqui senectutis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>morbo gravor, gravissime cruciarunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Palpito <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nunc, gratia dei, utcunque; sed pedes et corporis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>bases molem sexagenariam tametsi exuctam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>exhaustamque magna portant difficultate, ita ut <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>testudineo gradu ex aedibus in templum domini <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>promoveam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Ich bett teglich mit bruder <persName>Clausen</persName>: <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>O gott, nem mich mir und gib mich gancz <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>zu eigen dir.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Fiat domini voluntas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Ecclesię satis bene habent eo nomine, quod <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>adversariis, qui cupiunt semper aliquid novitatis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>studiosi mutare, nil hactenus concesserimus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Sunt in ducatu, qui excidium minantur, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>unum vel alterum interemistam admiserimus; verum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>illorum terriculamenta surda aure transimus, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nec hactenus aliquid mutarunt principe etiam nostro <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>constanter reluctante.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Maior pars etiam ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>per nos admonita frequentiores sunt in contionibus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et dictis diebus in precationibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Certe quidam, de <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quibus nulla spes erat resipiscentię, dolent calamitatem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>piorum innocentię vitę studentes; pusillanimes, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>qui Cęsaris metu in veritate Christi dubitantes animum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>propemodum desponderant, iam redeunt et utcunque <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>respirant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Proinde oro te et tuos symmystas in <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Christo Iesu servatore nostro, orate indesinenter pro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nobis, ne deficiat fides nostra et, quo magis <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ab adversariis impetimur, hoc magis constantiores <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>simus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Certe versipellis ille Satan miris technis <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>glorię Christi apud nos insidiatur, de quo longum foret <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>scribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Strasburgum</placeName> nutarat, et fratres inter se <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>non usque adeo conveniunt; iam sepius illos admonuimus <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ad concordiam; verum suum cuique pulcrum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Metuo, ne <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>falsorum fratrum pertinatia perdatur, quod absit etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Cęsar expectatur <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName>, ut nosti; sed qui hinc, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ubi nunc agit, ad nos veniunt, putant id nunquam <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>futurum; ita vehementer laborat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Orandus deus, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ut illum non solum, sed eos quoque, qui apud illum rer<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>um <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>pociuntur, illuminet sua solita clementia Christumque, salutis scopum, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>aperiat etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale in Christo, observande frater, et <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> omnesque fratres nostro nomine salutabis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant vos nost<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>ri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 23. maii 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Tuissimus ex animo <persName ref="p1010">Matthias Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Eximio viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>lingero</persName>, theologo et ecclesiastę <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> vigilantissimo, fratri in Ch<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>risto semper observando etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
